 <COL N="1314"></COL> districtione et cautela ventilabat
140  <HI REND="ITALIC">et seqq.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>Adaloaldus filius Agilulfi, 291.</ITEM> <ITEM>Adam. De Adae anima Joannis CP
error, 239.</ITEM> <ITEM>Adeodatus, Ecclesiae Ravennatis diaconus,
