Agnoitas scripsit Eulogius Alexandrinus,
291. Et Gregorius,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.,</HI>  79.</ITEM> <ITEM>Agricola, Severiani episcopi Ariani
filius, Pelagii in disseminanda haeresi
